---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'; import Button from '../components/Button.astro'; import FAQ from '../components/FAQ.astro'; import {site} from '../data/site';
const faq=[{question:'What is Playtomic used for?',answer:'Players can use Playtomic to discover participating clubs, check availability, book courts and find or manage games where those features are offered.'},{question:'Is Playtomic the same as coaching?',answer:'No. Playtomic helps with court and game activity. Coaching with Shayaan is a separate service delivered exclusively at Ace Padel.'},{question:'Are ratings official coaching levels?',answer:'A Playtomic rating is useful context inside its ecosystem, but this website does not present rating ranges as official coaching classifications.'},{question:'Where can I check cancellation rules?',answer:'Review the terms shown for the specific booking in Playtomic or ask the venue. Policies can vary and may change.'}];
---
<Layout title="Playtomic Kenya | Find Padel Games & Book Courts" description="Learn how to use Playtomic in Kenya to discover padel courts, find open matches, join games and manage bookings, plus coaching in Nairobi."><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Playtomic Kenya</div><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Padel in Kenya</p><h1>Playtomic Kenya: find games and book courts.</h1><p class="lead">A practical introduction for Nairobi players—and a bridge between discovering padel, getting coaching and joining the local game.</p><div class="button-row"><Button href={site.playtomicUrl} variant="lime" external event="playtomic_click">Open Playtomic</Button></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container prose"><h2>What is Playtomic?</h2><p>Playtomic is a sports booking and player platform used by padel communities around the world. Where Kenyan clubs participate, players can use it to explore court availability, organise bookings and discover games.</p><h2>Finding a court</h2><p>Open the app or website, set your location and review participating venues. Confirm the venue, date, time, price and cancellation terms before paying because live details belong to the club and platform.</p><h2>Finding and joining games</h2><p>Look for open matches that suit your location and level. Review the game details and participant information before joining. The website complements this flow rather than recreating matchmaking.</p><h2>Ratings and levels</h2><p>Ratings can help players find balanced games. They are not treated here as an official coaching classification. If you do not know your level—or want to play more confidently—coaching can provide a practical assessment of technique, positioning and match decisions.</p><h2>How coaching fits</h2><p>Use Playtomic to play. Use coaching to understand and improve how you play. Shayaan’s coaching takes place exclusively at Ace Padel, Aga Khan Sports Centre in Nairobi.</p></div></section><section class="section section--sand"><div class="container"><h2>Playtomic questions</h2><FAQ items={faq}/></div></section><section class="accent-cta"><p class="eyebrow">Want to improve your game?</p><h2>Train with Shayaan at Ace Padel.</h2><p>Build the technique, positioning and decisions that support better match performance.</p><Button href="/coaching" variant="dark">View Coaching</Button></section></Layout>
